<h1>About People in Centre</h1>

<p>
People in Centre (PiC) is an interdisciplinary practice,
research and learning organisation working towards
socially just, ecologically responsible and people-centred
approaches to development.
</p>

<p>
PiC works at the intersection of disaster resilience,
ecological balance, urban transformation and
institutional learning. Our work spans research,
technical assistance, policy support, capacity building
and field implementation across multiple countries.
</p>

<h2>What We Do</h2>

<ul>
<li>Research and knowledge generation</li>
<li>Technical assistance and advisory services</li>
<li>Capacity building and training</li>
<li>Policy and programme development</li>
<li>Socio-technical facilitation</li>
</ul>

</main>

